<title>USA: Travelers Group unit sells $200 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Travelers Group unit sells $200 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Smith Barney Holdings, a unit of Travelers Group Inc was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER SMITH BARNEY HOLDINGS</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.375 PCT  MATURITY 5/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.911  FIRST PAY DATE 11/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 7.388	 PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD +72 BP     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
